  "details": "Since cloning became a thing, visiting worlds for avatars has become a downward trend. \nA suggestion is to update avatar pedestals and keep reward avatars to players for visiting or participating and completing maps\n-A new tab in the avatar list where you can have these avatars saved with the upcoming UI update.\n-These avatars can be pedestal-only to incite players to go and earn it themselves and boost traffic to a map\n-Replace the clone button with \"Earn this avatar\" and send users to map\n-Furthermore, it doesn't take up favorite slots, as an added bonus\n\nA good solution would be to add options for upload\n>Private\n>Whitelist Only (people allowed on an individual basis)\n>Licensed (for if the license system starts really getting used, basically Whitelist Only but more automated)\n>Group Only (the upcoming group system)\n>Friends Only\n>Pedestal Only\n>Unlisted (If avatar Search becomes a feature)\n>Public",
